      'Opening deal: 2-4 player(s), 5 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in play; each_player_clockwise may use play_card before round end.',
      'Scoring check: Winner of the last trick scores: 3 points if the winning card is a 6, 2 if a 7, 1 if 8 or higher. No fixed target; session continues as players wish. When played for money, winner is paid 1, 2 or 3 stakes by each other player. Expected outcome: Win the last (fifth) trick; score 3, 2 or 1 point depending on the winning card (6, 7, or 8+)..',
